<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Staging Location</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top:0; }

    </style>
</head>
<body style="width: 300px">
    <h3>Staging Location</h3>
    <p>
        File contents are uploaded into a staging table before their contents are chunked and embedded.
        Specify whether to use an existing table or create a new one.
    </p>
    <br>
    <p>The staging table has the following structure:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ID</code> – The unique identifier of the file content</li>
        <li><code>FILE_CONTENT (BLOB)</code> – The content of the file</li>
        <li><code>FILE_SIZE</code> – The file size in bytes</li>
        <li><code>FILE_HASH</code> – Unique signature of the content</li>
        <li><code>METADATA (JSON)</code> – Metadata about the upload in JSON format</li>
    </ul>
</body>
</html>

